  "description": "See the current Escapade, the Tonic's steel sibling.\n\nThe luxurious Tonic was our drop bar dream bike: all the fun and capability of the Escapade, crafted from gorgeous, head-turning titanium. Fast tarmac, gravel, touring: the Tonic did it all in style.\n\nLightweight and comfortable, it would tackle whatever surface took your fancy. Sleek, tough and durable, it was ready to follow the tarmac out of the city and onto the dirt, or to be loaded up with bags for epic adventures, and was just as special on fast, racy tyres as on floaty gravel rubber. With its stunning polished finish, the Tonic simply oozed class.\n\nSizes: XS/52, Small/54, Medium/56 and Large/58 (latterly XS/52 only). Wheels: 700c, or 650b Road Plus.",
